research/audit/wave13-real-analysis.findings.md-89-but cites only `def-oscillation-in-rn` and `lem-oscillation-characterisation-in-rn`. Those targets license $D=\{x:\omega_f(x)>0\}$ and closedness of each positive superlevel. They do not license the reciprocal-integer decomposition of every positive real. That extra implication is stated exactly by the earlier `cor-archimedean-reciprocal`, which should be added as a dependency.
